    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After an absurd downpour of historic proportions, reservoirs overflowing set the stage for a farce of inundation as the ancient river swamped flood-ravaged regions in Syria. The solemn authority figure then appeared for a presidential photo-op, inspecting the collateral damage—life washed away, property damage, and structural failure—while military rescue squads performed their evacuation operation.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Jester",
