      "fit": 0.65
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Nature and dams colliding created a muddy bridge debacle and pushed the river past its embankments, turning homes, farms, and schools into a tragic spectacle. In response, the rescue boat circus deployed, offering a slim chance of rescue operation, while upstream power broker Turkey promised a water release agreement to ease the ongoing climatic anomaly.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Jester",
        "fragments": [
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "how-4",
