      ],
      "fit": 0.55
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The week-long disaster impact from the heavy rainfall saw young victims succumb to drowning incidents, exposing an infrastructure joke as the earthen bridge collapsed. The duty-bound visitor from the head of state's office toured the sites of flooding, a grim reminder of the agricultural loss, while the military branch negotiated an upstream concession to mitigate the water storage issue.",
